Adds desktop window options to sokol_app: borderless, topmost, unfocusable and taskbar-less windows that open at a given position with those options already in effect, sapp_set_window_focusable() to change the focus behavior while the app runs, per-pixel transparency on D3D11 through a DirectComposition swapchain with premultiplied alpha, and 32-bit ARGB visuals for transparent windows on X11 with GLX and EGL. Quitting through performClose: is replaced because borderless macOS windows have no close button.

